-*   **Tetrahedron:** Defined by 4 vertices $v_a, v_b, v_c, v_d$ and their scalar values $s_a, s_b, s_c, s_d$.
-*   **Vertex State:** Binary classification of each vertex relative to the isovalue (Inside/On or Outside/Off).
